{"title": "Infernal Binding (Hope) (Condition)", "pageid": 46989, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Infernal_Binding_(Hope)_(Condition)", "categories": ["No stack ID", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Control Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Infernal Binding</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Hope is <a href=\"/wiki/Immune\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Immune\">Immune</a> to all damage while imprisoned in the House of Hope.</li>\n<li>Immune to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Banished_(Condition)\" title=\"Banished (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Banished\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Banished_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Banished_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Banished_(Condition)\" title=\"Banished (Condition)\">Banished</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">LOW_HOH_HOPE_INFERNALPROTECTION</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOW_HOH_HOPE_INFERNALPROTECTION+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:LOW_HOH_HOPE_INFERNALPROTECTION+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This condition can only be removed from <a href=\"/wiki/Hope\" title=\"Hope\">Hope</a> with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orphic_Hammer\" title=\"Orphic Hammer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Orphic_Hammer\" title=\"Orphic Hammer\">Orphic Hammer</a></span>.</li>\n<li>The tooltip doesn't mention a hidden immunity to the Banished condition</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Infernal_Binding\">Creatures with Infernal Binding</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hope\" title=\"Hope\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png/30px-Portrait_Hope.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png/45px-Portrait_Hope.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png/60px-Portrait_Hope.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hope\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png/30px-Portrait_Hope.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hope\" title=\"Hope\">Hope</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715110647\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.055 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1653/1000000\